{"lyrics":"[00:02.88]California-catin' (CashMoneyAp)\n[00:13.76]Broke niggas pay attention, here's some motivation\n[00:15.26]Oh-na-na-na-na-na (BG On The Beat)\n[00:15.94]Ayy\n[00:16.04]Ayy, broke niggas pay attention, here's some motivation\n[00:17.28]I'm in L.A., counting cash and California-catin'\n[00:20.22]If I want it, I get a 'Rari just to drag race\n[00:23.40]We ashin' the floor of the foreign, we don't need no ashtray\n[00:26.58]And we keep it moving forward, we don't ever backspace\n[00:30.12]I heard you just bought a Ford, I'm finna buy a Mercedes\n[00:33.48]Early to the money, when these other niggas past-late\n[00:36.88]You can't have a convo' with me, 'til you get your cash straight\n[00:40.28]Woke up feeling rich bitch, but that's not enough\n[00:44.18]Codeine in my cup, uh, ain't no Robitus', huh\n[00:47.56]Fuck a pick me up, I really need a Perc-me-up\n[00:50.56]Me and my homies be doing drugs 'cause all of these hoes be irking us\n[00:53.92]You said you had a boyfriend five minutes ago, uh\n[00:57.42]Found out I got the bag, Ksubi jeans, no Balmain\n[01:00.88]Don't look at the tag, yeah, all these bitches fair game\n[01:04.32]Your ho might get smashed, you know she gon' fuck on a rubber band man\n[01:08.90]I spent fifty k within a month, ho, huh, I just put a zip into a blunt, ho\n[01:15.88]Niggas iffy, uh, I get on that \"Gummo\", got the sticky tucked, I will never, ever run, ho\n[01:21.96]Ayy, broke niggas pay attention, here's some motivation\n[01:25.36]I'm in L.A., counting cash and California-catin'\n[01:28.80]If I want it, I get a 'Rari just to drag race\n[01:31.98]We ashin' the floor of the foreign, we don't need no ashtray\n[01:35.16]And we keep it moving forward, we don't ever backspace\n[01:38.70]I heard you just bought a Ford, I'm finna buy a Mercedes\n[01:42.04]Early to the money, when these other niggas past-late\n[01:45.44]You can't have a convo' with me, 'til you get your cash straight\n[01:48.90]You know we can't conversate, you a broke boy, you a librarian, you make no noise\n[01:56.20]A vegetarian, you want no beef, think you know it all? Bitch, you don't know me\n[02:03.08]And I can't trust these niggas, they be police\n[02:06.36]The type to tell on all they friends, and they homies\n[02:09.62]Don't need no friends, I can do it by my lonely\n[02:12.56]It's only one of me, fuck nigga try to clone me\n[02:17.16]Mask on my face, bitch, trick or treat, uh\n[02:20.52]Glock kinda hungry, take it out to eat, ayy\n[02:24.04]Gettin' big, damnit, I'ma have a feast, uh\n[02:27.44]Pretty nigga shooting, Beauty and the Beast, yeah\n[02:30.84]Ayy, broke niggas pay attention, here's some motivation\n[02:33.92]I'm in L.A., counting cash and California-catin'\n[02:37.36]If I want it, I get a 'Rari just to drag race\n[02:40.54]We ashin' the floor of the foreign, we don't need no ashtray\n[02:43.74]And we keep it moving forward, we don't ever backspace\n[02:47.28]I heard you just bought a Ford, I'm finna buy a Mercedes\n[02:50.62]Early to the money, when these other niggas past-late\n[02:54.02]You can't have a convo' with me, 'til you get your cash straight","words":[[2.88,7.18,"California-catin'"],[13.04,13.72,"(CashMoneyAp)"],[13.76,13.88,"Broke"],[13.92,14.1,"niggas"],[14.16,14.32,"pay"],[14.36,14.56,"attention,"],[14.6,14.78,"here's"],[14.84,14.94,"some"],[14.98,15.2,"motivation"],[15.26,15.5,"Oh-na-na-na-na-na"],[15.54,15.56,"(BG"],[15.6,15.62,"On"],[15.66,15.72,"The"],[15.76,15.84,"Beat)"],[15.94,16.0,"Ayy"],[16.04,16.1,"Ayy,"],[16.14,16.22,"broke"],[16.26,16.38,"niggas"],[16.42,16.46,"pay"],[16.5,16.68,"attention,"],[16.72,16.82,"here's"],[16.86,16.96,"some"],[17.0,17.24,"motivation"],[17.28,17.32,"I'm"],[17.38,17.44,"in"],[17.48,17.5,"L.A.,"],[17.54,17.92,"counting"],[17.98,18.24,"cash"],[18.28,18.36,"and"],[18.42,19.86,"California-catin'"],[20.22,20.3,"If"],[20.5,20.5,"I"],[20.6,20.78,"want"],[20.86,20.94,"it,"],[21.06,21.06,"I"],[21.14,21.24,"get"],[21.3,21.3,"a"],[21.38,21.62,"'Rari"],[21.86,22.0